# Freeze: Bill-wise linked voucher Show more / Show less (hard)

Read **`AGENTS.md` → “Freeze: Bill-wise linked voucher Show more / Show less”** before editing matched files or the same UI in `TransactionsTable.tsx`.

## Do not (without explicit human approval in that chat)

- Edit, refactor, or “small fix” `LinkedVouchersColoredCollapsible`, `LINKED_VOUCHERS_COLLAPSED_COUNT`, or swap back to full `LinkedVouchersColored` on status / bill-wise rows while doing unrelated ledger, print, or theme work.
- Change default collapsed count, button labels (`Show more (+N)` / `Show less`), or remove `stopPropagation` on the toggle while fixing other table clicks.
- Re-expand all linked voucher nos by default on Partial/Paid status rows.

## Proceed only when the human clearly asks

Examples: “show more link voucher change karo”, “3 voucher dikhao collapse me”, “show less hatao” — in **that same message**.

## Preserve (web + EXE + APK)

- More than 2 linked bill-wise voucher nos → show **first 2** only until expanded.
- **Show more (+N)** expands full list; **Show less** collapses.
- Toggle click must not open voucher row edit (`stopPropagation`).
- Same component on desktop status under badge, narration bill-wise detail, and mobile bill-wise linked lines (`TransactionsTable`).
